@startuml

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #777777
  FontSize 11
  Padding 20
}

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #333333
  FontSize 10
  Padding 15
}

title Authoritative Communication Lifecycle Architecture

left to right direction

actor "Diagnostic Client" as Client

package "Request Interface" {
  component "Request Admission" as RequestAdmission
  component "SOVD API" as API
}

package "Communication Management" {
  component "Authoritative\nCommunication Plugin\n(applies init_mode policy)" as Plugin
  component "CommunicationHandle +\nLifecycle Worker" as Lifecycle
  component "HTTP Protection\nRegistry" as Protections
  component "CommunicationAccess\n(narrow view)" as Access
  component "DisableCommunication\n(narrow view)" as Disable
}

package "Diagnostic Runtime" {
  component "Diagnostic Operations" as Diagnostics
  component "Vehicle Transport" as Transport
}

component "Runtime Update" as Update

Client --> RequestAdmission : HTTP request
RequestAdmission --> API : admitted request
API --> Diagnostics : diagnostic operation

Diagnostics --> Access : acquire CommunicationGuard,\ninspect state and\nvariant_detection()
Diagnostics --> Access : request_activate() when\nnot ready, then answer\npending immediately
RequestAdmission --> Protections : first matching protection\nselects response
Access --> Plugin : forwards to the same\nselected plugin
Plugin --> Lifecycle : activate, request_activate,\ntrigger_detection, disable\nprivate handle
Lifecycle --> Transport : enable or disable\n(lazy DoIP socket bind\ninside enable())
Diagnostics --> Transport : communicate with vehicle

Update --> Protections : own UpdateInProgress\nprotection (409)
Update --> Disable : acquire sole\nDisableLease
Update --> Diagnostics : replace runtime components

note bottom of Plugin
  Startup-selected public facade.
  Sole place init_mode policy is applied.
  No event channel or restricted-request hook:
  a consumer that finds communication not ready
  calls request_activate() through its own view.
end note

note bottom of Lifecycle
  Capacity-8 command mailbox; sole owner of
  transport and initializers.
  Admission is durable and coalesced; shutdown
  uses an out-of-band barrier.
end note

note bottom of Protections
  Runtime update owns an opaque UpdateInProgress
  token. Dropping it removes only its own record.
end note

@enduml
